<title>UK: EDS alliance gets $420 mln Italian contract.</title>
<headline>EDS alliance gets $420 mln Italian contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. group Electronic Data Systems Corp said on Wednesday it and Italian State Railways received a four-year contract in Italy valued at $420 million.</p>
<p>The contract involved developing and implementing a new information technology infrastructure for the Italian Ministry of Education, EDS said in a statement released here.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
